Z||000000||elfiero||09-13-2000||10:34 AM||||This question is for all you guys with 4spd<BR>automatic trannys.what did you do to correct<BR>speedometer error? (reads twice as fast as<BR>normal.)I'm think'in I need to purchase one<BR>of those electronic ratio adapters-$130.00!<BR>any other ideas would be greatly appreciated,<BR>thanks!||||reg||5
