Z||000012||terryk||09-14-2000||12:21 PM||||That should be 4000 PPM. Strange. Page 8A-80-4 (I believe) of the manual shows the VSS as being 4k (and therefore the trans) and the ECM and cruise being 2k (divide by 2).<P>Never heard of an 8k gear driven.<P>Sounds like gremlins. Good luck.||||reg||1
